{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1078"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/countries","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__countries.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",947],["+"," Bavaria is also Saxony's south-western neighbour inside Germany, around the Vogtland town of Plauen; going clockwise, Saxony's other German neighbours are Thuringia to the west, Saxony-Anhalt to the north-west and Brandenburg to the north, while Hesse lies well beyond Thuringia and never touches it."],["=",81],["+","(Bavaria to the southwest) "],["=",87]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",849],["+"," Bayern ist zugleich Sachsens südwestlicher Nachbar innerhalb Deutschlands, rund um das vogtländische Plauen; die übrigen deutschen Nachbarn Sachsens sind Thüringen im Westen, Sachsen-Anhalt im Nordwesten und Brandenburg im Norden, während Hessen jenseits von Thüringen liegt und Sachsen nirgends berührt."],["=",77],["+","(Bayern im Südwesten) "],["=",89]]}]},
